			"Message": "docs(Echo): Normalize whitespace and update Rust version in README and docs\n\nReplace non-standard em-space characters with standard U+2001 and collapse unnecessary HTML whitespace in Architecture.md, DeepDive.md, and README.md for consistent rendering across markdown parsers.\n\nUpdate the Rust toolchain badge from 1.75+ to 1.95.0+ to match the edition 2024 requirement documented in DeepDive.md. Add a License section and a Changelog section with proper heading hierarchy to the README, bringing it in line with the project's documentation conventions.\n\nThis is purely a documentation and formatting cleanup with no functional changes to the scheduler code.\n\nRefs #736",
